::X|EN|gr.copilot.del.018|                    clicking the taskbar removes it without any policy
::X|EN|gr.copilot.del.019|                    value and without the managed-by-your-organization
::X|EN|gr.copilot.del.020|                    marking.
::X|EN|gr.copilot.del.021|
::X|EN|gr.copilot.del.022|  Unverified      : On 24H2 and 25H2 Copilot ships as an ordinary Store
::X|EN|gr.copilot.del.023|                    app (Microsoft.Copilot). TurnOffWindowsCopilot governs
