::X|FR|db.cdm.suggestions.off.024|                      changes nothing functionally but the report should
::X|FR|db.cdm.suggestions.off.025|                      not say it restored something that was never there.
::X|FR|db.cdm.suggestions.off.026|
::X|FR|db.cdm.suggestions.off.027|  Cible           : reg add on HKCU\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVers
