::X|FR|reg.gamedvr.enabled.026|                      confirmed on the live machine, since the honesty
::X|FR|reg.gamedvr.enabled.027|                      argument in the gain field rests on it.
::X|FR|reg.gamedvr.enabled.028|
::X|FR|reg.gamedvr.enabled.029|  Cible           : reg add HKEY_CURRENT_USER\System\GameConfigStore /v
::X|FR|reg.gamedvr.enabled.030|                    GameDVR_Enabled /t REG_DWORD /d 00000000 /f - OPTY.bat
