::X|EN|net.nic.eee.off.011|
::X|EN|net.nic.eee.off.012|  Unverified      : The 0.5 W per port figure is the commonly cited
::X|EN|net.nic.eee.off.013|                    802.3az saving for a gigabit copper PHY, not a
