::T|FR|net.nti.profile.choice.028|
::T|FR|net.nti.profile.choice.029|  Defaut Windows  : 10 (0x0000000a).
::T|FR|net.nti.profile.choice.030|
::T|FR|net.nti.profile.choice.031|  Valeurs possibles :
