::X|FR|fsutil.disablelastaccess.027|
::X|FR|fsutil.disablelastaccess.028|  Cible           : fsutil behavior set disablelastaccess <N> - OPTY.bat
::X|FR|fsutil.disablelastaccess.029|                    line 505 (-fad writes 1) and line 506 (+fad writes 2).
