::X|FR|gr.8dot3.default.012|
::X|FR|gr.8dot3.default.013|  Cible           : fsutil behavior set disable8dot3 2 - OPTY.bat line
::X|FR|gr.8dot3.default.014|                    1635, in the RESTORE path (Restoring 8.3 short names
